                <ITEXT CH="Moss-"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="DejaVu Sans Mono Oblique" CH="Nostoc"/>
                <ITEXT CH=" symbioses are &quot;loose&quot;, better predicted by environmental conditions than host moss phylogeny. "/>
                <para PARENT="listBox"/>
                <ITEXT CH="Mosses in the forest canopy are under selection pressure to enter into symbioses with nitrogen-fixing bacteria due to ephemeral environmental nitrogen sources. "/>
